Z||000012||SCCA FIERO||05-21-99||02:03 PM||||Umm....Are you guys sure 88 GTs have rear sway bars? I looked at one today and unless it's hidden up inside somewhere I couldn't see one. I couldn't spot any end links or anything....   Am I blind? BTW this car is a "BRAND NEW" 88 GT. If anyone is interested in this car e-mail me and I will break your heart with the price! It is at the local Pontiac dealer. He kept the last one he got in and never sold it! 
Z||000013||Phil||05-21-99||05:11 PM||||All 88GT s should have rear sway bars, the coupes didn't but the GTs did. BYW my 88GT has only 22k
Z||000014||ChadMan||05-22-99||06:59 AM||||A guy with an '88 Formula showed me his sway bar (no bad jokes, please!) at the 1997 Nationals - it looked like it was somehow tucked into the rear cradle!  As there were almost 200 Fieros to see, I didn't have much time to really study the sway-bar arrangement, but I remember thinking it might be a bear to add a rear sway bar to my '88 Coupe.<p>Anybody with an '88 GT or Formula want to clue us in?
Z||000015||mrfiero||06-05-99||11:26 PM||||Both '88 Formulas and GT's have a rear sway bar (I've owned 2 '88 GTs and 3 Formulas).  Retrofitting one to an '88 coupe is basically a bolt on deal.....you will need the sway bar, end links, strut brackets and the 2 clamp/bushings for the cradle from a donor Formula/GT. You will need to partially remove the cradle to get it in place.  It's a little tricky, but not out of reach for the backyard mechanic.  
Z||000016||SCCA FIERO||06-06-99||12:43 AM||||Hi mrfiero! Are you new? I don't think i have seen you around. I started this thread with an 88 coupe auto tranny in mind. I bought an 88 coupe with a 5 speed instead and it handles GREAT! It had a busted endlink on the front swaybar when i bought it and handled better than the 86SE V6 I have too. I want the rear swaybar, but I don't think I could find a factory unit. Maybe an aftermarket unit? I plan to put the V6 from my 86 in this 88 one day so I will need a heavyduty one if I go aftermarket. Know where factory one is??
Z||000017||Ross||06-12-99||11:48 AM||||mrfiero,Ive been looking to purchase an 88 formula,and was wondering if there is any difrence between formulas and GT's? Besides cosmetics. Performance should be the same right?
